          "format": "date-time",
          "description": "Server-stamped last-write time."
        }
      },
      "description": "OnboardingState is the durable, tenant-scoped slice of launch-center UI\nstate. It deliberately does NOT carry a \"completed\" flag: completion is\nderived live from whether the tenant has providers, agents, and keys, so a\npersisted flag would go stale the moment a user deletes a provider. Only the\ngenuinely-fragile bits that would otherwise live in browser localStorage are\nstored here, so they survive a cleared cache or a fresh device."
    },
